  <div class="faq_section--area">
    <div class="faq_section--inner">
      <div class="faq_title">
        <h2 id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq_items--holder" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
        <div class="faq_items--item">
          <div class="faq_items">
            <button type="button" class="faq_items--top" id="faq-trigger-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-1">
              <span class="faq_items--title">
                <span>Are there any requirements for joining?</span>
              </span>
              <span class="faq_items--icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg
                  width="23"
                  height="23"
                  viewBox="0 0 23 23"
                  fill="none"
                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                >
                  <path class="icon-path-1" d="M1.78125 11.8555H21.2473" stroke="black"
                      stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                  <path class="icon-path-2" d="M11.5156 21.5911V2.125" stroke="black"
                      stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                </svg>
              </span>
            </button>

            <div class="faq_items--answer" id="faq-answer-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-1">
              <p>
                Yes! To be considered for the program, have an active Blue Tees GAME Membership, at least 5,000
                followers on a public social media account (Instagram, TikTok, or YouTube) and post golf-related content
                regularly.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq_items--item">
          <div class="faq_items">
            <button type="button" class="faq_items--top" id="faq-trigger-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2">
              <span class="faq_items--title">
                <span>How do I become a Blue Tees GAME member?</span>
              </span>
              <span class="faq_items--icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg
                  width="23"
                  height="23"
                  viewBox="0 0 23 23"
                  fill="none"
                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                >
                  <path class="icon-path-1" d="M1.78125 11.8555H21.2473" stroke="black"
                      stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                  <path class="icon-path-2" d="M11.5156 21.5911V2.125" stroke="black"
                      stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                </svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq_items--answer" id="faq-answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-2">
              <p>
                Download the Blue Tees GAME App and follow the instructions when you create an account, or simply click
                the link <a href="/pages/membership">here</a> to get started.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq_items--item">
          <div class="faq_items">
            <button type="button" class="faq_items--top" id="faq-trigger-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3">
              <span class="faq_items--title">
                <span>What does the commission (revenue) structure look like?</span>
              </span>
              <span class="faq_items--icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg
                  width="23"
                  height="23"
                  viewBox="0 0 23 23"
                  fill="none"
                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                >
                  <path class="icon-path-1" d="M1.78125 11.8555H21.2473" stroke="black"
                      stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                  <path class="icon-path-2" d="M11.5156 21.5911V2.125" stroke="black"
                      stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                </svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq_items--answer" id="faq-answer-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-3">
              <p>
                Ambassadors start with a 10% commission on every sale through their unique affiliate code. As you drive
                more sales, your commission rate can grow up to 30%, unlocking higher earnings and additional perks
                along the way.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq_items--item">
          <div class="faq_items">
            <button type="button" class="faq_items--top" id="faq-trigger-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4">
              <span class="faq_items--title">
                <span>How long will my application take to be reviewed?</span>
              </span>
              <span class="faq_items--icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg
                  width="23"
                  height="23"
                  viewBox="0 0 23 23"
                  fill="none"
                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                >
                  <path class="icon-path-1" d="M1.78125 11.8555H21.2473" stroke="black"
                      stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                  <path class="icon-path-2" d="M11.5156 21.5911V2.125" stroke="black"
                      stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                </svg>
