            </button>
            <div class="faq_items--answer" id="faq-answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-4">
              <p>
                We review applications on a rolling basis and typically respond within 5-7 business days. If selected,
                you’ll receive a welcome kit with next steps!
              </p>
            </div>
